● | global geopolitical conditions resulting from political and economic instability, including wars, terrorism and political unrest, including the outbreak of hostilities in Ukraine and the Middle East and potential instability in Venezuela, outbreak of disease, boycotts, curtailment of trade and other business restrictions;

